@startuml
title KiwiDB — Component Diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2

actor "Developer /\nApplication" as App
actor "Operator /\nExaminer" as Op

package "Interfaces" {
  package "CLI / REPL" as CLI
  package "Web Dashboard (React SPA)" as Web
  package "REST + WebSocket API (FastAPI)" as API
}

package "KiwiDB" {
  component "Engine Core\n(LSMEngine)" as Engine
  component "MemTable Subsystem" as Mem
  component "Write-Ahead Log" as WAL
  component "SSTable Store" as SST
  component "Compaction" as Comp
  component "Block Cache" as Cache
  component "Bloom + Sparse Index" as Idx
  component "Observability\n(structlog + TCP broadcast)" as Obs
  component "Config" as Cfg

  interface "put/get/delete/flush" as IKV
  interface "append/replay/truncate" as IWAL
  interface "flush/get/commit" as ISST
  interface "check_and_compact" as ICOMP
  interface "get/put block" as ICACHE
  interface "may_contain / floor_offset" as IIDX
  interface "log events" as ILOG
}

App --> IKV
Op --> CLI
Op --> Web
Web --> API
CLI --> IKV
API --> IKV

Engine - IKV
Engine ..> IWAL
Engine ..> ISST
Engine ..> ICOMP
Engine ..> Mem
Engine ..> Cfg

WAL - IWAL
SST - ISST
Comp - ICOMP
Cache - ICACHE
Idx - IIDX
Obs - ILOG

SST ..> ICACHE
SST ..> IIDX
Comp ..> ISST
Comp ..> IIDX
Engine ..> ILOG
API ..> ISST : inspect levels
API ..> Mem : inspect memtable
API ..> ILOG : stream logs (WS)

@enduml
